# Express Server
Server that takes json-ld triples through the port 3000.

# Installing the packages
1. Install the jsonld
```
npm i jsonld
```
2. The project is an express in typescript with body-parser middleware installed.

```
npm i -D express body-parser
npm i -S @types/express @types/body-parser
```
3. JSON Parser
```
npm i content-type
```

# Execution
```
tsc && node dist/server.js
```

# Heroku
